  // in_channels=6, out_channels=7, kernel_size=3, stride=1 (default), padding=0 (default)
  // StableHLO convolution expects input: [batch, feature, height, width]
  // ConvTranspose2d is a transposed convolution, which can be implemented by convolution with lhs_dilation and rhs_dilation.
  // Here, stride=1, padding=0, so lhs_dilation=kernel_size=3, rhs_dilation=1, padding=0.
